{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "93135313d1487c100cbf3910101dcfd16b6b26a2910b2501dea44c8fc25f8a38", "ja": "{$P$}さん、この衣装、本当に……\nすっごくカワイイですよね！　ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，这套服装，真的……\n真的好可爱喔！谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7025d1f26a182cb509c8d032df591b4cedef4607335bfb41e35335e209fc0cd6", "ja": "喜んでもらえてよかった。\nうん、サイズもデザインも、ぴったりだな。", "zh": "你喜欢真是太好了。\n嗯，衣服的尺寸跟设计都非常适合你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "af63921dad02c05881fb353c5015f756c30209efd0922b779c55fdf27dcda250", "ja": "こんなお洋服、もし小さい頃にもらっちゃってたら、私\nお料理のオママゴトばっかりしてたかもしれません。", "zh": "这么漂亮的洋装，如果是我小时候收到的话，\n我可能会一天到晚沉迷在玩扮家家酒做菜的游戏里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "0a00d11123abaeef89bdcdd5b2bf72cffcb8208fb0f67f5e39aa6bf9cf1b0bd1", "ja": "すっかりコックさんとか、パティシエさん気分で♪\nあ、もしかしたら、そのままプロを目指してたかも！", "zh": "然后就假装自己成了大厨、甜点师♪\n啊，说不定还会认真想往这方面发展呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1004_p", "source_sha256": "93a2bb5550bd2319360db049fe93214c669aaf1a8bca66e62b2ac20d729668bc", "ja": "だとしたら、俺は春香と出会えなかっただろうから……\nそうならなくて良かったよ。", "zh": "那样一来，我也不会遇见春香了吧……\n幸好没有发生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "5d44814441518828bbc674e0aa6efe90ac989bd2be6657e8cefb0f41009b21e9", "ja": "はっ、そうでした！　うう、すみません～。\nでも大丈夫です。私、歌のほうが好きでしたから！", "zh": "啊，对喔！呜呜，对不起～\n不过你不用担心，因为我更喜欢唱歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1006_p", "source_sha256": "09b32fac59b748da847ecba45608b72f0dc6350d66cf2b6e47f52500c7045ebc", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。それなら俺も安心だ。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你。这样我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "9e5b2def2fc6e9bd5a85bf233794c3396096e859c733aee00a43fd13be853995", "ja": "えへへ……。あ、でも今は本当に、お料理ももっと\n上手になりたいって思ってるところなんですよ？", "zh": "嘿嘿……啊，但是现在，\n我是真的希望自己的厨艺可以再进步一些喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1008_p", "source_sha256": "694b384d218e7703a2c8ee5c72b9456794d4e3c3d5f103890bc82c3aec928ee3", "ja": "へえ、そうなのか。\nもしかして、この衣装がきっかけで？", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。\n难道是因为这套服装的关系？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "f081c54b4818e7440c52abd0442043b1b7203a9c0ecd9fc38b3e1d68309a1ae5", "ja": "それもありますけど……{$P$}さん、\n私が書いたブログ、見てくれました？", "zh": "虽然这也是原因之一……{$P$}先生，\n你有看我写的部落格吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1010_p", "source_sha256": "78f0338b2be960c6d6259c34366bd0cf8e7480217891fca9b117f93dff10c240", "ja": "ああ、ブログなら見たけど。\nそんなこと、書いてあったっけ？", "zh": "有啊，部落格我看了。\n但你有写到这方面的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "cc66986cff6e1c55e9887dad74daab29294a895e02590308b342cd0f35faaa09", "ja": "いえ、私が書いたことじゃなくて。あのブログに、\n小さい女の子がコメントをくれたんです。", "zh": "不，不是关于我写的内容。\n是在部落格上，有个小女生留言给我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "bea4a51d535931fccec744ce386e97fa3fd4bfd6632bd28a4a5b168aa757f441", "ja": "「春香ちゃんのお料理、たべてみたい！」って。\nえへへっ。だから、私……。", "zh": "她说：「好想尝尝看春香做的菜！」\n嘿嘿，所以我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "336c4baef333a952cfd8e7dd35a2ac2a599552581185f1ef406b927c45024e45", "ja": "いつか本当に、ファンのみんなに、おいしいお料理を\n振る舞いたいな～、なんて思っちゃったんです♪", "zh": "希望有一天，可以真的让自己的粉丝们，\n尝到亲手煮的美味料理～我是这么想的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c6ced84a2f77b677423dd9488a5e12354503394616bd4cc792d34d8443af5cf6", "ja": "なるほど……。本当に春香の手料理を食べられたら、\nファンの人たちは、そりゃあ大喜びだろうな。", "zh": "原来如此……如果真的能尝到春香做的料理，\n粉丝们一定会开心得手舞足蹈吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "2b4f13556ca06b5d4b3b8999f2bc74b940e82160c7d18c826531c97fc1789a65", "ja": "そうですよね、喜んでくれますよねっ？\n鍋物とか煮物なら、実現できそうって思いますし！", "zh": "对吧，他们会很高兴吧？\n而且我觉得煮火锅或炖菜，可行性好像都挺高的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "04bcf0d8f74e418db79ddefd8e7e5c7e119c563a1dadca5f7f289bced9d9f6fb", "ja": "みんなで食べる、あったか～いお料理……。\nえへへ、きっと楽しいだろうな～♪", "zh": "大家一起享用暖呼呼～的料理……\n嘿嘿，场面一定会很和乐～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1017_p", "source_sha256": "22e1eee1992b4b90cc13eb5974fa537fde5a49a7aa518b886fa490bebf1a00dd", "ja": "となると、春香。トップアイドルを目指す理由が、\nまたひとつ増えたんじゃないか？", "zh": "这么说来，春香。\n你要成为顶尖偶像的理由，是不是又多了一个呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "7c2dc125121c982ef4280acf315a3939770995c37dc80deeef119e190cc81858", "ja": "え？　トップアイドルになれば……\nもしかして、お料理も上手になったりするんですか！？", "zh": "咦？成为顶尖偶像的话……\n厨艺也会跟着突飞猛进是吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1019_p", "source_sha256": "35fc5f8fcbc86bf976fd7ac7cd57925b90dc19a6ec8194f0c7736fe57a866055", "ja": "そんなウマい話はないが……料理だけに。\nいや、そうじゃなくて。", "zh": "哪有那么简单就能尝到甜头……毕竟是料理。\n不，我不是这个意思啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1020_p", "source_sha256": "66818e1af52c7d4df786e54112e2ba53a206b279bf81214b4094a5563464f313", "ja": "トップアイドルになれば、当然ファンもすごい数に\nなる。だから、トップアイドルになって……。", "zh": "成为顶尖偶像的话，粉丝人数当然也会直线上升。\n所以，成为顶尖偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1021_p", "source_sha256": "54acf4afaf8cb1092533df528eea0d9f49049aa89887d1bdc8223532d7e465fb", "ja": "できるだけたくさんの人に、春香の料理を振る舞おう！", "zh": "尽可能让更多的人，尝到春香的料理吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "e1de9af526000849365953a868f0c4bfe941e801fcf53901ff80424291cdf33d", "ja": "わぁ……！\nわかりました、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "哇……！\n我知道了，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0064_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "2178daf55b13d350172432a4bd7e05ea748dbb0266ac16cfcb8fb97c1cad3e78", "ja": "天海春香、いつかきっと、トップアイドルになって……\nみんなと一緒に、お鍋をつつきます♪　えへへっ！", "zh": "天海春香，总有一天一定要成为顶尖偶像……\n跟大家一起围炉吃火锅♪嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
